        <activityName xml:lang="en">Titanium dioxide at plant, sulphate process, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Titanium dioxide at plant, sulphate process, at plant
Titanium dioxide produced by the sulfate process is preferred for paper, ink, rubber and a variety of specialty applications. Inventory data are confidential;
CAS number: 013463-67-7; 
Formula: TiO2; 
Synonyms: rutil; 
UUID: f29ea928-dad4-33fe-ac09-33391c25e0ae
Cradle-to-gate, includes all ancillary materials, precursors, transports and infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: represents a current cross-section of actual plants in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: survey 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f29ea928-dad4-33fe-ac09-33391c25e0ae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
